	"Author": "labixiaoluwan",
	"Description": "[CP]:\n<br />Add a new Catalogue named \"Red Fox And Rain Frog Catalogue Desk\",you can go to Robin's and buy for it,then you will own 60 new furnitures.\n<br />\n<br />Pre-mods:\n<br />SMAPI,\n<br />Content Patcher,\n<br />Content Patcher Animations(For the animatied fountain),\n<br />Calcifer.\n<br />\n<br />[CP]mode has Chinese version and English version,just download as you need.\n<br />\n<br />[AT]:\n<br />Pre-mods:SMAPI,Content Patcher,Alternative Textures.\n<br />\n<br />This is my first time making code for CP mode. I am very excited. Hope you like my work : )\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n<br />[CP]模式：\n<br />为您的游戏新增一个名为“赤狐与雨蛙家具目录”的新家具目录（不会覆盖任何原版家具），您只需要去罗宾那里购买这个新的家具目录即可。\n<br />前置mod：SMAPI；Content Patcher；Content Patcher Animations（因为家具中包含一个可动喷泉）;Calcifer。\n<br />[CP]模式拥有中文版和英文版，请根据您的需要下载。\n<br />\n<br />[AT]模式：\n<br />前置mod：SMAPI；Content Patcher；Alternative Textures\n<br />\n<br />这是我第一次写CP代码，觉得很兴奋，很高兴。\n<br />如果您是中国玩家，可以关注我的小红书账号：小鹿丸与草莓（小红书号：26201926633），我会在那里更新我的mod制作的相关讯息。希望大家喜欢我的作品！",
